{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1340819-soul-parts-and-pillars","id":1340819,"title":"Soul parts and Pillars","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-11T12:08:25-07:00","id":1340819,"title":"Soul parts and Pillars","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> I have been tangentially interested in Mummy for a while (Mage is my main interest), and seeing that in Dark Eras, we have a detailed correspondence between subtle arcana and pillars, I just got myself wondering &quot;What about the Soul?&quot;<br /> <br /> Mummies have an understanding of a multipart soul, but what does each piece do? I have been reading a bit about the Egyptian conception of the soul and I draw blanks:<ul><li><b>AB</b>: <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Emotions and intentions, got it.</span></li> <li><b>BA</b>: Personality, identity and passions, this is the closest to current Occidental conception of a soul.</li> <li><b>KA</b>: The vital essence. Let's call it the &quot;battery&quot; of the soul.</li> <li><b>REN</b>: Your name... Does it imply destiny? Attributes?</li> <li><b>SHEUT</b>: Shadow... ??? What does it do?</li> </ul><br /> <br /> If anyone can help, with some examples, to clarify... I tried to use a Linux analogy, but since I don't understand perfectly my analogy falls short and its probably wrong:<br /> <br /> <b>Ren </b>is the filename, <b>Ba </b>are the file contents, <b>Ka </b>is the physical part of the file (What is actually modified in the hard drive), <b>Sheut </b>is the metadata (owner, permissions), and I fall short for <b>Ab</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-11T12:54:24-07:00","id":1340827,"title":"","content":"Bit of a kludge to mesh together what I understand of the historical Egyptian associations with their depiction as Pillars in Mummy:<br /> <br /> <b>Ab, the <i>Heart:</i></b> Emotions. Outlook. Being described by your feelings and motives. <i>You are what drives you.</i><br /> <b>Ba, the <i>Spirit:</i></b> Personhood as an action set into motion. Initiative and behavior. Being described by your performed deeds. <i>You are how you choose to act.</i><br /> <b>Ka, the <i>Essence:</i></b> Life, animating energy, that which separates you from objects merely acted upon. Being described by your nature and agency. <i>You are what distinguishes you from others.</i><br /> <b>Ren, the <i>Name:</i></b> Meaning as can be passed on and expressed independent of your physical being. Being described by stories, roles, and contexts. <i>You are what you mean to the world.</i><br /> <b>Sheut, the <i>Shadow:</i></b> Representation. The capacity for being depicted. Being described by shape, image, and form. <i>You are the impression and mark you make on the world.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","user":"Stupid Loserman","date":". 10-11-2019, 04:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-11T13:04:41-07:00","id":1340829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1340819-soul-parts-and-pillars?p=1340827#post1340827\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bit of a kludge to mesh together what I understand of the historical Egyptian associations with their depiction as Pillars in Mummy:<br /> <br /> <b>Ab, the <i>Heart:</i></b> Emotions. Intentions. Having will and motive. Being described by your inner thoughts. <i>You are what you think and feel.</i><br /> <b>Ba, the <i>Spirit:</i></b> Personhood as incarnate through living action. Being described by your performed deeds. <i>You are the things you do.</i><br /> <b>Ka, the <i>Essence:</i></b> Life, animating energy, that which separates you from objects merely acted upon. Being described by your nature and agency. <i>You are what distinguishes you from others.</i><br /> <b>Ren, the <i>Name:</i></b> Meaning as can be passed on and expressed independent of your physical being. Being described by stories, roles, and contexts. <i>You are what you mean to the world.</i><br /> <b>Sheut, the <i>Shadow:</i></b> Representation. The capacity for being depicted. Being described by shape, image, and form. <i>You are the impression and mark you make on the world.</i><br /> <br /> Looking over Princes of the Conquered Land briefly, the last three align fairly well with their associated subtle Arcana. Perhaps I am a little off in my attempt to interpret the Ab and the Ba? Or perhaps I am close but a little rephrasing would better spotlight what associates them with Spirit and Mind.</div> </div> </div> </div>If this is right, then shouldn't the pillar correspondence be: Ab = Mind, Ba = Spirit??","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-11T13:09:42-07:00","id":1340830,"title":"","content":"Taking in mind the associations in the Conquered Land, I think I see what my take is now, and have edited my post accordingly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}